        "TileImage": "$($repository 856b2aa2-e224-48c3-b890-01fdf4dba6de).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon, 47. There are pastry vendors operating in the town, and—let&apos;s just say—their hygiene standards are appalling; recent reports on their production site revealed cockroaches and other issues. Your objective is to eliminate them quietly. The method is up to you, but the client insists on no stray bullets hitting the walls—shots must land precisely in the targets&apos; bodies. You also need to finish by 3:30; according to the client, they plan to slip a poisoned donut to a real estate agen",
